# SEO

## Metadata API
Every page exports `metadata` or `generateMetadata`:
```tsx
export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: '...',
  description: '...',
  openGraph: { title, description, images, locale },
  alternates: { canonical, languages: { ro, en } },
};
```

## Structure
- One `h1` per page matching primary keyword
- Descriptive `title` (50–60 chars), `description` (150–160 chars)

## Technical
- `sitemap.ts` and `robots.ts` in app root
- Semantic URLs: `/ro/facultati/inginerie-electrica`
- JSON-LD for Organization on homepage (future)

## Performance = SEO
- Optimize LCP (hero image/font), CLS (explicit dimensions), INP (minimal client JS)
